<section class="band band--white">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Platform settings</p>
    <h1>Sign-in methods</h1>
    <p>Choose how people may sign in, and what each method counts for. At least one method must stay enabled as a first factor.</p>
  </div>

  {{#if saved}}
    <div class="callout callout--success"><strong>Settings saved.</strong></div>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if errorMessage}}
    <div class="callout callout--warning"><strong>Not saved.</strong> <span>{{errorMessage}}</span></div>
  {{/if}}

  <article class="blade-guidance">
    <strong>First factor vs second factor</strong>
    <span><em>First factor</em> means the method can start a sign-in. <em>Completes sign-in</em> means finishing it is enough on its own — no separate code is asked for. A passkey or wallet approval with biometric verification is already possession plus inherence, so an extra code adds friction without adding assurance. A password is neither, so it can never complete a sign-in by itself. <em>New accounts</em> allows someone to enrol with only that method and no password; they receive recovery codes at enrolment and must confirm their email before the account is useful.</span>
  </article>

  <form class="wizard-form" action="/admin/sign-in-methods" method="post">
    <table class="data-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Method</th>
          <th>Enabled</th>
          <th>First factor</th>
          <th>Completes sign-in</th>
          <th>New accounts</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#each methods}}
          <tr>
            <td>
              <strong>{{this.label}}</strong>
              <div class="table-note">{{this.description}}</div>
              {{#unless this.implemented}}
                <div class="table-note"><em>Not available yet.</em></div>
              {{/unless}}
            </td>
            <td>
              <input type="checkbox" name="method_{{this.id}}_enabled" value="true"
                {{#if this.enabled}}checked{{/if}}
                {{#unless this.implemented}}disabled{{/unless}}
                aria-label="Enable {{this.label}}">
            </td>
            <td>
              <input type="checkbox" name="method_{{this.id}}_first" value="true"
                {{#if this.firstFactor}}checked{{/if}}
                {{#unless this.canBeFirst}}disabled{{/unless}}
                aria-label="{{this.label}} may start a sign-in">
            </td>
            <td>
              <input type="checkbox" name="method_{{this.id}}_second" value="true"
                {{#if this.satisfiesSecond}}checked{{/if}}
                {{#unless this.canSatisfySecond}}disabled{{/unless}}
                aria-label="{{this.label}} completes a sign-in on its own">
            </td>
            <td>
              {{#if this.canEnrol}}
                <input type="checkbox" name="method_{{this.id}}_enrol" value="true"
                  {{#if this.allowEnrolment}}checked{{/if}}
                  aria-label="Allow new accounts to be created with {{this.label}}">
              {{else}}
                <span class="table-note">—</span>
              {{/if}}
            </td>
          </tr>
        {{/each}}
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="inline-actions">
      <button class="button button--primary button--blue" type="submit">Save methods</button>
      <a class="button button--ghost" href="/admin">All settings</a>
      <a class="button button--ghost" href="/admin/notifications">Notification delivery</a>
      <a class="button button--ghost" href="/admin/registration-codes">Registration codes</a>
    </div>
  </form>
</section>
